# studies-archive-gifs-2026

Animations produced by the archived `good_notebooks/archive/*` notebooks (two event-hit animations
and one charge-optimisation animation). Superseded by `lucid.viz.animate_event`, which regenerates
them from a dataset.

| file | size | produced by |
|---|---|---|
| `good_notebooks/figures/event_hit_animation.gif` | 5.7 MB | `archive/event_hit_animation.ipynb` |
| `good_notebooks/figures/event_hit_animation_4.gif` | 4.6 MB | `archive/event_hit_animation.ipynb` |
| `good_notebooks/figures/optimization_event_0_charge.gif` | 2.9 MB | `archive/tracking_opt_with_gif.ipynb` |

The notebooks are in `studies-archive-notebooks-2026`. Nothing in `lucid/`, `analysis/` or `tests/`
reads a GIF; these were committed for a README that no longer shows them.
